  "text": "proprium.sancti-thomae-apostoli-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Saint Thomas the Apostle” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "O Lord, we who dutifully worship You humbly entreat You that, by the prayers of Your blessed Apostle Thomas, in honor of whose martyrdom we offer these sacrifices of praise, You safeguard Your gifts within us. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
